  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v11.0.0\n- Add .NET 11.0 target.\n- Drop .NET 8.0 targets (BREAKING)\n- InvalidModelException renamed to InvalidModel. (BREAKING)\n- Rely on built-in collection merging isntead of home-brew collection.\n- Prevent creation of a valid Result<T> without setting T when struct. (BUG)\n- ValidationMessages is an immutable collection, and type of Messages in Result. (BREAKING)\n- Act(Async)(Func<TModel, TOut>) to simplify applying transforms.\n- Validator.Composite<TModel>() creates a composite Ivalidator<<TModel>.\n- IHttpStatusMessage to bind an IValidationMessage to an HTTP status.\nv2.1.0\n- Add notnull constraint to Result.For<T>().\nv2.0.0\n- Add Result.ThrowIfInvalid().\n- Add .NET 10.0 target.\n- Drop .NET9.0 targets. (BREAKING)\nv1.0.0\n- Add .NET 9.0 target.\n- Drop .NET 5.0, NET6.0, NET7.0 targets. (BREAKING)\n- Drop public Diagnostics.Contracts. (BREAKING)\n- Drop binary serialization on exceptions. (BREAKING)\nv0.3.0\n- Add Result<T>.Cast<TOut>(). #61\n- Support .NET 7.0. #62\nv0.2.1\n- Nullable anotations. #48\nv0.1.3\n- Result.Null() also for (nullable) structs. #46\nv0.1.2\n- Dealing with Result.Null() values internally should not throw. #42\nv0.1.1\n- Decorate pure methods with attribute. #38\nv0.1.0\n- ContinueOnCapturedContext is configurable. #35\n- Introduction of Result.Null<T>(). #34\n- Disallow Result<T>.For(null). #34\n- Act() and ActAsync() are also executed for null values. #34\n- Result.OK is static readonly field (was static property). #32\n- Improvements on InvalidModelException. #31\nv0.0.5\n- Act() methods on context. #29\n- AsTask() method for Result<T>. #28\nv0.0.4\n- Act() methods have pipe notation alternatives.",
